# Smart Home fault trace: a corrupted / noise-flooded device stream (short
# circuit, broken sensor, or data exploit) must NEVER reach the hardware.
# The compile-time Safe-Fail firewall catches the oversized payload and
# refuses to emit any binary — the appliance stays physically disengaged.
# Run it: sentryc examples/device_fault.pi   (blocked, exit code 2)
LINK PIN 18 TO SMART_DOOR_LOCK AS OUTPUT
FORCE OVERRIDE SMART_DOOR_LOCK WITH "CORRUPTED_DATA_STREAM_NOISE" * 40000